	"description": [
		"Students examine local, metro, and national news while learning to write both hard news and features. Subject areas may include covering meetings and business, reviewing arts and food, and/or writing about sports and travel. Students also learn UPI/AP copy-editing and proofreading, important skills for internships and print media jobs. Offered periodically. Prerequisites: WRIT 120 or equivalent and at least sophomore status."
